## What to deliver

Build the berg sprite up operation by operation until the image in `canvas.png`
matches the brief — a jagged, faceted, three-dimensional chunk of ice with sharp
top points, shaded facets, dark cracks, and snow highlights, reading as a hard
dangerous hazard (not a flat floe), in the cold ice palette on full transparency.
When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded `actions.json` is your finished
submission.
